{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-11T07:24:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2098311753763524644"],"id":"2098311753763524644","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":41729,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":96,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我悟出一个道理，不管是在学校还是处身社会，人善被人欺，马善被人骑，越是善良好欺负，别人越是要欺负你，反倒是凶巴巴的看起来很不好惹，谁看到都会对你客客气气，这就是人性哎...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2098311753763524644"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-10T09:34:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097982077153186132"],"id":"2097982077153186132","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":49664,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":106,"retweet_count":0},"text":"白天送外卖晚上学知识，我刚碰见一道棘手之题，半个小时了毫无思绪，有没有学霸可教我一下？ https://t.co/E2a2ym26Td","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097982077153186132"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-10T01:21:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097858082852520438"],"id":"2097858082852520438","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":47464,"like_count":226,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2097857939310883141","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"她退学之后，那个照片还在传，学校论坛里全是要链接的。我后来清理网盘的时候看到过，立马删了但我删不掉别人手机里的，没办法我现在想起来还觉得恶心，不是恶心照片，是恶心自己当时没有举报","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097858082852520438"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-10T01:21:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097857939310883141"],"id":"2097857939310883141","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":107566,"like_count":756,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":420,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我上职高班里有个女的，文文静静的，被校园霸凌拍了那种照片，不知道为什么被发班群里了，她报警了，警察来了，学校说“会处理”。但是我们都不知道怎么处理的，那女的退学了，听说她后来抑郁了。我不知道她现在还在不在.......","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097857939310883141"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:22:20.000Z","edit_history_twe